  next_2: "<b>Publica-la.</b> Un cop, a pypi.org: <i>Publishing</i> → <i>Add a new pending publisher</i> (el teu repositori, workflow <code>publish.yml</code>, environment <code>pypi</code>). Després a GitHub <i>Releases</i> → <i>Draft a new release</i> → una etiqueta com <code>v0.1.0</code> → <i>Publish</i>, i el <a href=\"https://github.com/emkay-voice/skill-template/blob/main/.github/workflows/publish.yml\"><code>publish.yml</code></a> de la plantilla la puja a PyPI. Amb un entry point, un paquet a PyPI i una release, Klondike la diu <i>Looks Complete</i>.",
